# Client ID of the Fiken app (public client with PKCE, no secret). Used by the web app (dev)
# and the CLI. In CI it comes from the repository variable FIKEN_CLIENT_ID.
NEXT_PUBLIC_FIKEN_CLIENT_ID=

# Dev only: extra origins allowed to load the Next dev server (comma-separated hostnames,
# e.g. a tunnel or preview host). Leave unset in production. Register the same host's
# /auth/callback in the Fiken app redirect URIs if you need OAuth there.
# ALLOWED_DEV_ORIGINS=preview.example.com

# CLI only: a personal API key instead of OAuth (requires asking api@fiken.no). Wins if set.
# FIKEN_API_TOKEN=
